## Outcome and conditions

Derive random-walk moments and differences and select between deterministic detrending and stochastic differencing without claiming an unprepared unit-root test. All essential components listed in metadata are required. Hypothetical assessment values instantiate the checked equations; they are not historical observations or observed outcomes. Independent checks are closed-note and without hints, solution access, external retrieval or other assistance; a basic arithmetic calculator is allowed. Teach establishes and records actual help/exposure conditions before claiming independence.

